  "root_cause": [
    "The owner was directed to source projects rather than an exact exported and hash-bound review artifact.",
    "The FIXTURE-08 project was only a readiness self-report and had no human-review interaction.",
    "The shared execution presentation script used ResourceLoader.get_resource_type(), which is unavailable in the observed Summer Engine API, and inferred Variant-derived values without explicit types, causing parse failure before runtime.",
